      "en": "He took for himself a potsherd to scrape himself with, and he sat among the ashes.",
      "ko": "욥이 재 가운데 앉아서 기와 조각을 가져다가 몸을 긁고 있더니",
      "source_text_hash": "216966aa70e938e9f92fcd2de37764b26132459834832fa5d074179ca220eb1b",
      "translation_text_hash": "d648058b4c1722cdaa943c70d090b4e33ae62ee03d62ff5ac5e9133cd6a568bd",
