        {
          "book": "JOB",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "When they lifted up their eyes from a distance, and didn’t recognize him, they raised their voices, and wept; and they each tore his robe, and sprinkled dust on their heads toward the sky.",
      "ko": "눈을 들어 멀리 보매 그 욥인줄 알기 어렵게 되었으므로 그들이 일제히 소리질러 울며 각각 자기의 겉옷을 찢고 하늘을 향하여 티끌을 날려 자기 머리에 뿌리고",
      "source_text_hash": "2c37807c2f6b9d54860fd80e2c4d51e57a034e6ff75797ecdf9e546ae3902a36",
      "translation_text_hash": "ebf3e949111f4ebd0c045606aef1f7ddee02250b003b3dd8ddb1ef19b5e20684",
